@translation labeled en project








$ (in the following translation, mss. are referred to by the sigla used by Vincente 1995; from those listed there, mss. Fi, Go, P6, and WB 62 were not used; if not specified by a note, numerical data come from ms. WB)

@(1 = 1-39) After the kingship descended from heaven, the kingship was in @wSN{Eridug}. In @wSN{Eridug}, @wRN{Alulim} became king; he ruled for 28800 years. @wRN{Alalŋar} ruled for 36000 years. 2 kings; they ruled for 64800 years. Then @wSN{Eridug} fell and the kingship was taken to @wSN{Bad-tibira}. In @wSN{Bad-tibira}, @wRN{En-men-lu-ana} ruled for 43200 years. @wRN{En-men-gal-ana} ruled for 28800 years. @wRN{Dumuzid}, the shepherd, ruled for 36000 years. 3 kings; they ruled for 108000 years. Then @wSN{Bad-tibira} fell (?) and the kingship was taken to @wSN{Larag}. In @wSN{Larag}, @wRN{En-sipad-zid-ana} ruled for 28800 years. 1 king; he ruled for 28800 years. Then @wSN{Larag} fell (?) and the kingship was taken to @wSN{Zimbir}. In @wSN{Zimbir}, @wRN{En-men-dur-ana} became king; he ruled for 21000 years. 1 king; he ruled for 21000 years. Then @wSN{Zimbir} fell (?) and the kingship was taken to @wSN{Šuruppag}. In @wSN{Šuruppag}, @wRN{Ubara-@wDN{Tutu}} became king; he ruled for 18600 years. 1 king; he ruled for 18600 years. In 5 cities 8 kings; they ruled for 241200 years. Then the flood swept over.

@(40 = 40-94) After the flood had swept over, and the kingship had descended from heaven, the kingship was in @wSN{Kiš}. In @wSN{Kiš}, @wRN{Ŋušur} became king; he ruled for 1200 years. @wRN{Kullassina-bēl} ruled for  @varh[t211.v1]{960 } @vart[t211.v2,t211.v1]{@varn{ms. P2+L2 has instead:} 900 } years. @wRN{Nanŋišlišma} ruled for @varn{ms. P2+L2 has:}  @varh[t211.v501]{670 } (?) years. @wRN{En-taraḫ-ana} ruled for @varn{ms. P2+L2 has:}  @varh[t211.v502]{420 } years ……, 3 months, and 3 1/2 days. @wRN{Babum} …… ruled for @varn{ms. P2+L2 has:}  @varh[t211.v503]{300 } years. @wRN{Puannum} ruled for  @varh[t211.v3]{840 } @vart[t211.v4,t211.v3]{@varn{ms. P2+L2 has instead:} 240 } years. @wRN{Kalibum} ruled for  @varh[t211.v5]{960 } @vart[t211.v6,t211.v5]{@varn{ms. P2+L2 has instead:} 900 } years. @wRN{Kalūmum} ruled for  @varh[t211.v7]{840 } @vart[t211.v8,t211.v7]{@varn{mss. P3+BT14, Su1 have instead:} 900 } years. @wRN{Zuqāqīp} ruled for  @varh[t211.v9]{900 } @vart[t211.v10,t211.v9]{@varn{ms. Su1 has instead:} 600 } years. @note{in mss. P2+L2, P3+BT14, P5, the 10th and 11th rulers of the dynasty precede the 8th and 9th}  @varh[t211.v11]{@wRN{Atab} } @vart[t211.v12,t211.v11]{@varn{mss. P2+L2, P3+BT14, P5 have instead:} @wRN{A-ba} } ruled for 600 years. @wRN{Mašda}, the son of @wRN{Atab}, ruled for  @varh[t211.v13]{840 } @vart[t211.v14,t211.v13]{@varn{ms. Su1 has instead:} 720 } years. @wRN{Arwium}, the son of @wRN{Mašda}, ruled for 720 years. @wRN{Etana}, the shepherd, who ascended to heaven and consolidated all the foreign countries, became king; he ruled for  @varh[t211.v15]{1500 } @vart[t211.v16,t211.v15]{@varn{ms. P2+L2 has instead:} 635 } years. @wRN{Baliḫ}, the son of @wRN{Etana}, ruled for  @varh[t211.v17]{400 } @vart[t211.v18,t211.v17]{@varn{mss. P2+L2, Su1 have instead:} 410 } years. @wRN{En-me-nuna} ruled for  @varh[t211.v19]{660 } @vart[t211.v20,t211.v19]{@varn{ms. P2+L2 has instead:} 621 } years. @wRN{Melem-Kiš}, the son of @wRN{En-me-nuna}, ruled for 900 years.  @vart[t211.v21,t211.v21]{@varn{ms. P3+BT14 adds:} 1560 are the years of the dynasty of @wRN{En-me-nuna}. }  @varh[t211.v22]{@wRN{Barsal-nuna}, the son of @wRN{En-me-nuna}, } @vart[t211.v23,t211.v22]{@varn{mss. P5, P3+BT14 have instead:} @wRN{Barsal-nuna} } ruled for 1200 years. @wRN{Zamug}, the son of @wRN{Barsal-nuna}, ruled for 140 years. @wRN{Tizqār}, the son of @wRN{Zamug}, ruled for 305 years.  @vart[t211.v24,t211.v24]{@varn{ms. P3+BT14 adds:} 1620 + X ……. } @wRN{Ilku} ruled for 900 years. @wRN{Iltasadum} ruled for 1200 years. @wRN{En-me-barage-si}, who made the land of @wGN{Elam} submit, became king; he ruled for 900 years. @wRN{Aga}, the son of @wRN{En-me-barage-si}, ruled for 625 years.  @vart[t211.v25,t211.v25]{@varn{ms. P3+BT14 adds:} 1525 are the years of the dynasty of @wRN{En-me-barage-si}. } 23 kings; they ruled for 24510 years, 3 months, and 3 1/2 days. Then @wSN{Kiš} was defeated and the kingship was taken to @wTN{E-ana}.

