@(95 = 95-133) In @wTN{E-ana}, @wRN{Meš-ki-aŋ-gašer}, the son of @wDN{Utu}, became lord and king; he ruled for  @varh[t211.v26]{324 } @vart[t211.v27,t211.v26]{@varn{ms. P2+L2 has instead:} 325 } years. @wRN{Meš-ki-aŋ-gašer} entered the sea and disappeared. @wRN{Enmerkar}, the son of @wRN{Meš-ki-aŋ-gašer}, the king of @wSN{Unug},  @varh[t211.v28]{who built @wSN{Unug} } @vart[t211.v29,t211.v28]{@varn{mss. L1+N1, P2+L2 have instead:} under whom @wSN{Unug} was built }, became king; he ruled for  @varh[t211.v30]{420 } @vart[t211.v31,t211.v30]{@varn{ms. TL has instead:} 900 + X } years.  @vart[t211.v32,t211.v32]{@varn{ms. P3+BT14 adds:} 745 are the years of the dynasty of @wRN{Meš-ki-aŋ-gašer}. } @vart[t211.v33,t211.v32]{@varn{ms TL adds instead:} ……; he ruled for 5 + X years. } @wRN{Lugalbanda}, the shepherd, ruled for 1200 years. @wRN{Dumuzid}, the fisherman whose city was @wSN{Kuara}, ruled for  @varh[t211.v34]{100 } @vart[t211.v35,t211.v34]{@varn{ms. TL has instead:} 110 } years.  @vart[t211.v36,t211.v36]{@varn{ms. P3+BT14 adds:} He captured @wRN{En-me-barage-si} single-handed. } @wRN{Gilgameš}, whose father was a phantom (?), the lord of @wSN{Kulaba}, ruled for 126 years. @wRN{Ur-@wDN{Nungal}}, the son of @wRN{Gilgameš}, ruled for 30 years. @wRN{Udul-kalama}, the son of  @varh[t211.v37]{@wRN{Ur-@wDN{Nungal}} } @vart[t211.v38,t211.v37]{@varn{ms. Su1 has instead:} @wRN{Ur-lugal} }, ruled for 15 years. @wRN{Lā-baʾšum} ruled for 9 years. @wRN{En-nun-taraḫ-ana} ruled for 8 years. @wRN{Meš-ḫe}, the smith, ruled for 36 years.  @varh[t211.v39]{@wRN{Melem-ana} } @vart[t211.v40,t211.v39]{@varn{ms. Su2 has instead:} @wRN{Til-kug} (?) …… } ruled for  @varh[t211.v41]{6 } @vart[t211.v42,t211.v41]{@varn{ms. Su2 has instead:} 900 } years. @wRN{Lugal-kitun} (?) ruled for  @varh[t211.v43]{36 } @vart[t211.v44,t211.v43]{@varn{ms. Su2 has instead:} 420 } years. 12 kings; they ruled for  @varh[t211.v45]{2310 } @vart[t211.v46,t211.v45]{@varn{ms. Su2 has instead:} 3588 } years. Then @wSN{Unug} was defeated and the kingship was taken to @wSN{Urim}.

