@(134 = 134-147) In @wSN{Urim}, @wRN{Meš-@wDN{Ane}-pada} became king; he ruled for 80 years.  @varh[t211.v47]{@wRN{Meš-ki-aŋ-@wDN{Nanna}} } @vart[t211.v48,t211.v47]{@varn{ms. P2+L2 has instead:} @wRN{Meš-ki-aŋ-nuna} }, the son of @wRN{Meš-@wDN{Ane}-pada}, became king; he ruled for  @varh[t211.v49]{36 } @vart[t211.v50,t211.v49]{@varn{ms. P2+L2 has instead:} 30 } years. @wRN{Elulu} ruled for @varn{mss. L1+N1, P2+L2, P3+BT14 have:}  @varh[t211.v504]{25 } years. @wRN{Balulu} ruled for @varn{mss. L1+N1, P2+L2, P3+BT14 have:}  @varh[t211.v505]{36 } years. @varn{mss. L1+N1, P2+L2 have:}  @varh[t211.v506]{4 } kings; they ruled for @varn{mss. L1+N1, P2+L2, P3+BT14 have:}  @varh[t211.v507]{171 } years. Then @wSN{Urim} was defeated and the kingship was taken to @wSN{Awan}.

